    "description": "Commons (level 1), level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). A round paved plaza 13 across, level with the grass, at a road junction: a statue of the king on a stepped plinth in the middle, ringed paving, gravel spokes, planters; later levels add the statue, benches, lanterns, a notice board, banners and a market stall. Decoration step adds: sign_text.",
